---
import { BASE, REPO_URL } from '../data/site';

const blob = `${REPO_URL}/blob/main/examples/wrong-behaviour`;
---

<section class="slip-compare" aria-labelledby="slip-heading">
  <h2 id="slip-heading" class="slip-heading">One pasted amount, two totals</h2>
  <div class="slip-pair">
    <div class="slip slip-wrong">
      <p class="slip-label">The assistant's total, all 40 amounts</p>
      <p class="slip-figure">€7,414</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slip slip-right">
      <p class="slip-label">Total with the repeat removed (39 months)</p>
      <p class="slip-figure">€7,281</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="slip-reason">One amount was pasted twice. The reply noticed 40 amounts for 39 months, then added all 40.</p>
  <p class="slip-caption">Observed: in 20 of 20 recorded runs the headline total included the repeat and every reply flagged the mismatch. claude-sonnet-5-5, Claude Code 2.1.310, 2026-10-25. <a href={`${blob}/runs/2026-10-25/raw/C01-bills-total-long-unlabelled-t01.txt`}>Raw reply</a>, <a href={`${BASE}/evidence/`}>all counts</a>.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .slip-compare {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .slip-heading {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
    color: var(--ahg-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 0;
  }
  .slip-pair {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }
  .slip {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--ahg-radius-card);
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-block-start-width: 0.35rem;
  }
  .slip p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .slip-label {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .slip-figure {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--ahg-text);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .slip-wrong {
    background: var(--ahg-wrong-soft);
    color: var(--ahg-wrong);
  }
  .slip-right {
    background: var(--ahg-right-soft);
    color: var(--ahg-right);
  }
  .slip-reason {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
    color: var(--ahg-text);
  }
  .slip-caption {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    color: var(--ahg-muted);
  }
</style>
